# CARTO basemap API key.
#
# Local development: copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the key.
#   cp .env.example .env.local
# `.env.local` is gitignored (via the `*.local` rule) so the key is never committed.
#
# CI / GitHub Pages: set a repository secret named CARTO_KEY
#   Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions -> New repository secret
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml passes it to the build as VITE_CARTO_KEY.
#
# The key is baked into the built bundle and sent with every tile request, so it
# is public once deployed. Restrict it to the site's domain in the CARTO
# dashboard — that, not secrecy, is what protects it.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
